The TrainCord membership auto-renewing subscription details are as follows:

By becoming a TrainCord premium, you can unlock all premium features, enjoy future free updates, and benefit from an ad-free experience.

Once you confirm the purchase and submit payment, the subscription fee will be automatically renewed via your iTunes account. The Apple iTunes account will deduct the fee within 24 hours prior to the expiration of the subscription period, and the subscription period will be extended by one subscription period after a successful deduction. If you wish to cancel the auto-renewal, please manually disable this function in the iTunes/AppleID settings management at least 24 hours before the current subscription period expires. If your iTunes account does not cancel the subscription during the free trial period, it will automatically activate the subscription and charge the fee upon trial period expiration, and any unused trial period will be invalid after purchasing the subscription. This service is optional for you, and if you choose not to cancel, it will provide you with the renewal service for the next billing period.

